uzlib, the compression side, from github.com/pfalcon/uzlib (zlib license).
Files: genlz77.c, defl_static.c, defl_static.h, crc32.c, uzlib.h (trimmed
to the compression API).

Changes for the dongle:
- outbits() writes into a caller-sized buffer and sets `overflow` instead
  of growing it with realloc.
- zlib_start_block() marks blocks as not final; zlib_sync_flush() ends a
  block with an empty stored block so the stream decodes up to that point;
  zlib_finish_stream() ends the stream with a final empty stored block.
  zlib_finish_block() is gone.
- uzlib_hash_add() enters bytes into the hash table without emitting,
  used after the window slides.
